WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.627
Yay, it looks delicious!

00:00:02.752 --> 00:00:04.504
I love hamburger patties!

00:00:05.380 --> 00:00:07.215
Nothing suspicious in there, right?

00:00:08.216 --> 00:00:11.344
Of course not.
That patty is 100% pure beef.

00:00:11.469 --> 00:00:12.595
Not cut with anything!

00:00:12.637 --> 00:00:15.932
Then what's this onion
doing in here? Well?

00:00:16.057 --> 00:00:19.185
I finely ground them to hide them,
but she noticed?!

00:00:19.769 --> 00:00:22.355
Oh, I heard you like curry too!

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:23.523
This curry here--

00:00:23.648 --> 00:00:25.066
I can smell it.

00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:29.988
It's been ground into a paste and boiled,
but there's carrot hidden in here.

00:00:30.613 --> 00:00:33.324
This kid's sense of smell…
She's like a drug-sniffer dog!

00:00:33.366 --> 00:00:34.826
There's green pepper in this.

00:00:34.909 --> 00:00:35.952
Spinach in this.

00:00:37.078 --> 00:00:37.912
No…

00:00:38.663 --> 00:00:40.665
Didn't think I'd know?

00:00:40.707 --> 00:00:43.126
Her clearance rate is 100%!

00:00:43.209 --> 00:00:45.545
Anything to say for yourself?

